ropriateFeedbackCount":0,"TotalClientResponseCount":0,"TotalCommentCount":0,"Photos":[{"Sizes":{"normal":{"Id":"normal","Url":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86dHJhZWdlcnNlcnZpY2U/f72aa3cd-51ba-5d89-85bb-47c25226b9f6"},"thumbnail":{"Id":"thumbnail","Url":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86dHJhZWdlcnNlcnZpY2U/82994197-a1e9-57e7-9253-491f3c683625"},"large":{"Id":"large","Url":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86dHJhZWdlcnNlcnZpY2U/8ec6e054-da35-57d4-a3f5-c96fd5731f9c"}},"Id":"16211431","SizesOrder":["normal","thumbnail","large"],"Caption":null}],"Rating":5,"IsRatingsOnly":false,"Helpfulness":1.0,"TotalFeedbackCount":4,"TotalNegativeFeedbackCount":0,"TotalPositiveFeedbackCount":4,"ModerationStatus":"APPROVED","SubmissionId":"r117661-en_1736457058gSIW8rb5","SubmissionTime":"2025-01-09T21:11:29.000+00:00","ReviewText":"The Traeger Woodridge Pro Pellet Grill is a game-changer. With its massive 970 sq. in. grilling space, you can easily handle a family cookout or an impromptu neighborhood BBQ (because trust me, the aroma will draw them in). The flat surfaces are perfect for prepping and staging, and the multiple hooks keep your tools handy\u2014no more scrambling around mid-flip. The real star, though? The Super Smoke feature, which transforms simple recipes into smoky masterpieces. The app integration adds a modern touch, letting you control temperatures without hovering like a nervous chef. Setup was a breeze, thanks to its top-notch packaging\u2014every piece arrived pristine. Plus, the grill\u2019s quality materials feel premium and built to last. I\u2019ve owned smokers, charcoal, and electric grills, and this is the all-in-one king of convenience, versatility, and flavor. Whether you\u2019re slow-smoking brisket or quickly searing steaks, this grill has your back. It\u2019s not just a grill\u2014it\u2019s a backyard revolution. Highly recommend this beast!","Title":"Traeger Woodridge Pro: Smoke, Sizzle, Perfection!","Us