-03-02T02:15:06.000+00:00","ProductId":"TFB97JLH","OriginalProductName":"Woodridge\u2122 Pro Pellet Grill","CampaignId":"ridge_all","ContextDataValuesOrder":["IncentivizedReview"],"UserLocation":"Washington","AuthorId":"3l2x3sdhk9e562jhi17m1x051","ContentLocale":"en_US","IsFeatured":false,"InappropriateFeedbackList":[{"AuthorId":"ztb9apo56quxlgu8w6onolclph","SubmissionTime":"2025-03-01T14:27:51.000+00:00"}],"TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount":1,"TotalClientResponseCount":0,"TotalCommentCount":0,"Rating":5,"IsRatingsOnly":false,"Helpfulness":1.0,"TotalFeedbackCount":2,"TotalNegativeFeedbackCount":0,"TotalPositiveFeedbackCount":2,"ModerationStatus":"APPROVED","SubmissionId":"r117661-en_17357935Ek0Xl24Qks","SubmissionTime":"2025-01-02T04:52:28.000+00:00","ReviewText":"The Traeger Woodridge is the markets next grill any new or well oiled back yard grill master needs! Experience the wood smoke flavor with the latest WiFire technology! Cleaning has been made an ease and the controls are bright and vibrant!","Title":"A Grill for Everyone!","UserNickname":"Andrew N.","ContextDataValues":{"IncentivizedReview":{"Value":"True","Id":"IncentivizedReview"}},"AdditionalFields":{},"CommentIds":[],"AdditionalFieldsOrder":[],"SecondaryRatings":{},"IsRecommended":null,"ProductRecommendationIds":[],"TagDimensionsOrder":[],"RatingRange":5,"Pros":null,"IsSyndicated":false,"Videos":[],"Cons":null,"SecondaryRatingsOrder":[],"ClientResponses":[],"Photos":[],"TagDimensions":{}},{"Id":"287133535","CID":"407f652d-7a8f-53bf-b6a0-de92ec5ebe44","SourceClient":"traegerservice","Badges":{"incentivizedReview":{"ContentType":"REVIEW","Id":"incentivizedReview","BadgeType":"Custom"}},"BadgesOrder":["incentivizedReview"],"LastModeratedTime":"2025-11-15T17:30:07.000+00:00","LastModificationTime":"2025-11-15T17:30:07.000+00:00","ProductId":"TFB97JLH","OriginalProductName":"Woodridge\u2122 Pro Pellet Grill","CampaignId":"ridge_all","ContextDataValuesOrder":["IncentivizedReview"],"UserLocation":"Utah","AuthorId":"2m1ic4ubn7hmw5o625tz3zqez","ContentLocale":"en_US","IsFeatured":false,"InappropriateFeedbackList":[{"AuthorId":"zp8bw8g1j1kp4wxopatm9kie62","SubmissionTime":"2025-11-15T17:08:39.000+00:00"}],"TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount":1,"TotalClientResponseCount":0,"TotalCommentCount":0,"Photos":[{"Sizes":{"normal":{"Id":"normal","Url":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86dHJhZWdlcnNlcnZpY2U/d92bcede-4116-55d8-a9ba-06d9e5a7915e"},"thumbnail":{"Id":"thumbnail","Url":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86dHJhZWdlcnNlcnZpY2U/0236141d-3b00-595c-b91f-d4b5cf61c9b7"},"large":{"Id":"large","Url":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86dHJhZWdlcnNlcnZpY2U/735d3ec6-37c0-5175-ada7-dda2507f38f0"}},"Id":"16029570","SizesOrder":["normal","thumbnail","large"],"Caption":null}],"Rating":5,"IsRatingsOnly":false,"Helpfulness":1.0,"TotalFeedbackCount":10,"TotalNegativeFeedbackCount":0,"TotalPositiveFeedbackCount":10,"ModerationStatus":"APPROVED","SubmissionId":"r117661-en_17349265YqGck0VPrP","SubmissionTime":"2024-12-23T04:02:45.000+00:00","ReviewText":"This grill exceeded my expectations.  Having owned several other Traeger Pellet Grills, I can not believe the flavor that the Woodridge has.  It compares to the way more expensive grills at a fraction of the price.  The ease of cleaning it is huge bonus as well.  Having assembled a number of Traeger Grills, this one did seem to have a few extra steps.  However, the way that its organized and shows on the box where to place all the items was super helpful.  The new display is super fun as well, sort of a retro 1980s game with the pixels.  It has all the added features I love such as super smoke, WiFire, and connecting wired probes for those longer cooks.  Love being able to control my grill from my phone through the app.  Lastly, the hopper seems huge on this grill.  love how large it is and seconds as an extra shelf to place items on.  Overall, very impressed with this grill and the price point is amazing for what you get.","Title":"Love the Woodridge Pro Grill","UserNickname":"@svenddiesel","ContextDataValues":{"IncentivizedReview":{"Value":"True","Id":"IncentivizedReview"}},"AdditionalFields":{},"CommentIds":[],"AdditionalFieldsOrder":[],"SecondaryRatings":{},"IsRecommended":null,"ProductRecommendationIds":[],"TagDimensionsOrder":[],"RatingRange":5,"Pros":null,"IsSyndicated":false,"Videos":[],"Cons":null,"SecondaryRatingsOrder":[],"ClientResponses":[],"TagDimensions":{}},{"Id":"287124420","CID":"8cb9b9e1-fca2-5b54-a33f-cce787628b9f","SourceClient":"traegerservice","Badges":{"incentivizedReview":{"ContentType":"REVIEW","Id":"incentivizedReview","BadgeType":"Custom"}},"BadgesOrder":["incentivizedReview"],"LastModeratedTime":"2025-03-03T11:30:04.000+00:00","LastModificationTime":"2025-03-04T19:37:46.000+00:00","ProductId":"TFB97JLH","OriginalProductName":"Woodridge\u2122 Pro Pellet Grill","CampaignId":"ridge_all","ContextDataValuesOrder":["IncentivizedReview"],"UserLocation":"Milwaukee, WI","AuthorId":"tkebsej1lchle35mdilmkcy6i","ContentLocale":"en_US","IsFeatured":false,"InappropriateFeedbackList":[{"AuthorId":"zea3k71mhcan36jbpmmy7112ma","SubmissionTime":"2025-03-02T16:06:58.000+00:00"}],"TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount":1,"TotalClientResponseCount":0,"TotalCommentCount":0,"Rating":4,"IsRatingsOnly":false,"Helpfulness":1.0,"TotalFeedbackCount":5,"TotalNegativeFeedbackCount":0,"TotalPositiveFeedbackCount":5,"ModerationStatus":"APPROVED","SubmissionId":"r117661-en_1734883259YrispLJC","SubmissionTime":"2024-12-22T16:00:15.000+00:00","ReviewText":"This Woodridge Pellet Grill has quickly become the centerpiece of my outdoor cooking. From juicy brisket to perfectly smoked ribs, this grill consistently impresses.\r\n\r\nReliability and Consistent Performance:\r\n\r\nOne of the most striking aspects of this grill is its remarkable reliability. It fires up quickly and maintains stable temperatures with impressive accuracy. Even during high winds, which can often wreak havoc on pellet grills, this model remains remarkably steady, ensuring consistent cooking throughout the entire smoke.\r\n\r\nUser-Friendly and Informative Display:\r\n\r\nThe new large display is a game-changer. It's incredibly easy to read, even in direct sunlight. The intuitive interface makes navigating settings and monitoring temperatures a breeze. This user-friendly design significantly enhances the overall cooking experience.\r\n\r\nOverall:\r\n\r\nThis Woodridge Pellet Grill is a top-tier smoker that excels in both performance and ease of use. Its reliability, consistent temperature control, and the exceptional new display make it a standout choice for serious home cooks and seasoned pitmasters alike.\r\n\r\nI highly recommend this grill to anyone seeking a premium smoking experience.","Title":"Woodridge Pellet Grill: A Smoker That Delivers","UserNickname":"Elizabeth Schlaefer","ContextDataValues":{"IncentivizedReview":{"Value":"True","Id":"IncentivizedReview"}},"AdditionalFields":{},"CommentIds":[],"AdditionalFieldsOrder":[],"SecondaryRatings":{},"IsRecommended":null,"ProductRecommendationIds":[],"TagDimensionsOrder":[],"RatingRange":5,"Pros":null,"IsSyndicated":false,"Videos":[],"Cons":null,"SecondaryRatingsOrder":[],"ClientResponses":[],"Photos":[],"TagDimensions":{}},{"Id":"286991205","CID":"4e18748b-f3b8-59f1-aa56-1b6915e88839","SourceClient":"traegerservice","Badges":{"incentivizedReview":{"ContentType":"REVIEW","Id":"incentivizedReview","BadgeType":"Custom"}},"BadgesOrder":["incentivizedReview"],"LastModeratedTime":"2024-12-19T12:45:04.000+00:00","LastModificationTime":"2025-01-17T15:51:16.000+00:00","ProductId":"TFB97JLH","OriginalProductName":"Woodridge\u2122 Pro Pellet Grill","CampaignId":"ridge_all","ContextDataValuesOrder":["IncentivizedReview"],"UserLocation":"Cumming, GA","AuthorId":"te0acaz08y78va3mqy3v4lzc3","ContentLocale":"en_US","IsFeatured":false,"TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount":0,"TotalClientResponseCount":0,"TotalCommentCount":0,"Rating":5