eger - and the improvements since my last basic grill are phenomenal!  From the ability to monitor and control the cook from my phone online, to the improved feed system, to the pellet level monitor and little touches like the hopper clean out hatch\u2026all new to me and what a huge difference it\u2019s made in the pleasure to use this grill.  I\u2019d love to be able to do upgrades after the fact, and still hope that could happen, but as it is, I\u2019m totally satisfied and happy to have this wonderful tool at my house.","Title":"Woodridge Pro Grill","UserNickname":"K Schmidt","ContextDataValues":{"IncentivizedReview":{"Value":"True","Id":"IncentivizedReview"}},"AdditionalFields":{},"CommentIds":[],"AdditionalFieldsOrder":[],"SecondaryRatings":{},"IsRecommended":null,"ProductRecommendationIds":[],"TagDimensionsOrder":[],"RatingRange":5,"Pros":null,"IsSyndicated":false,"Videos":[],"Cons":null,"SecondaryRatingsOrder":[],"ClientResponses":[],"TagDimensions":{}},{"Id":"286981337","CID":"3b56e40b-4c08-5f7f-aae3-2e57d0a6ffd2","SourceClient":"traegerservice","Badges":{"incentivizedReview":{"ContentType":"REVIEW","Id":"incentivizedReview","BadgeType":"Custom"}},"BadgesOrder":["incentivizedReview"],"LastModeratedTime":"2024-12-19T12:45:04.000+00:00","LastModificationTime":"2025-03-04T19:33:47.000+00:00","ProductId":"TFB97JLH","OriginalProductName":"Woodridge\u2122 Pro Pellet Grill","CampaignId":"ridge_all","ContextDataValuesOrder":["IncentivizedReview"],"UserLocation":"Indianapolis, IN","AuthorId":"igjnibxy645ax4nkggz492yt4","ContentLocale":"en_US","IsFeatured":false,"TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount":0,"TotalClientResponseCount":0,"TotalCommentCount":0,"Photos":[{"Sizes":{"normal":{"Id":"normal","Url":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86dHJhZWdlcnNlcnZpY2U/60869bc7-c6b0-5ef4-b279-6a3c471f00b3"},"thumbnail":{"Id":"thumbnail","Url":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86dHJhZWdlcnNlcnZpY2U/2de53ed8-8dd8-5a49-8a2b-2576d6ba9d6e"},"large":{"Id":"larg